{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0515b11fdd458a38229d9fa8f498fbded8887fdfe0d36f610bb962f1675b0703", "ja": "（今日は初めて、百合子が劇場のステージに立つ日だ。\n緊張していないかな……）", "zh": "（今天是百合子第一次站上剧场舞台的日子。\n她会不会紧张呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_003_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "8db1eaecda83268980b67b39e4fe5be5f486312a462148851bb82b8907811d52", "ja": "{$P$}さん……ど、どうしましょう。\nさっきからずっと、震えが止まらないです……！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……怎、怎么办？\n我从刚刚开始，就一直抖个不停……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_003_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c92c2f754adc51dad138cb3cf995247fccc4d7f9314d1a2457e31e3db3e6ec98", "ja": "大丈夫だ、百合子。自信を持とう。\nレッスンでやったこと、ちゃんと覚えてるだろ？", "zh": "没事的，百合子，你要有自信。\n毕竟训练课程教过的东西，你都记得很清楚吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_003_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "630a4fc9e554f11f5dbe737410f62a2bc5b8ee0c45ef28b95386a242b2e1bde5", "ja": "でも……お、お客さんの前で歌うんですよね？\n練習やリハーサルとも違って……。", "zh": "可是……要、要在观众面前唱歌对吧？\n跟练习和排练时不一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_003_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "872e7297c6b95293316cf9377a041294239f29bcb9fc5c69866f87b849a42fd7", "ja": "ううっ……\nふ、不安で、胸が張り裂けそうです……！", "zh": "呜呜……\n我、我好不安，胸口好像快裂开了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_003_1005_p", "source_sha256": "dc295c32ef117392d21659adf1be0dd5737c95b55f3b9b952a6d9c52b9f842f8", "ja": "うーん……なら、ステージの上の自分が成功する\nシーンを、思い浮かべてみるのはどうだ？", "zh": "唔……那你要不要试着想像自己站上舞台，\n成功完成演出的情景呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_003_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "e2f69695b54884d7d246b3e06267e89879c5d7f37d28185b12591d5691813bf0", "ja": "初ステージで、成功するシーンを想像……ですか？", "zh": "想像在首次表演中成功完成演出的情景……是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_003_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7b9c5f32e06f2dcc741711eaa0d775cd585423325571753dfb180fdc67684d5d", "ja": "ああ。自分を、物語の主人公だと思って……\n想像するのは得意だろう？", "zh": "嗯。把你自己当成故事的主角……\n你很擅长想像吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_003_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "87ea6115afd68650683fa71adea45616fe71c12b27066830c579e5f07f9049dc", "ja": "わ、わかりました！\n私、やってみますね！", "zh": "我、我知道了！\n我试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_003_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "6bc9475f0bc040c22964c4a87350811b45005f8ad4a6e3f002892dece1ccafa9", "ja": "えっと、ステージに上がって……ここが真ん中ですね。\nまずはお客さんに、挨拶をして……。", "zh": "呃，站上舞台……这边是正中间吧。\n首先向观众打招呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_003_1010_p", "source_sha256": "30435e1ff975a465a31d4015b9d7fbfe78d179462c39359e0664f4a8f781b2b9", "ja": "そうそう、その調子！", "zh": "没错没错，就是这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_003_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "ddc8467030d1ffe47aec5cc99b8b27f97dc551763b06c5e5a739ac1eaa4ec43b", "ja": "あぁ！？　「七尾百合子です」って言おうとして、\n「ななこぷりこれすっ」って、噛み噛みの私が～！", "zh": "啊！？想像到明明想说「我是七尾百合子」，\n却说成「窝四七维百额子」，一直吃螺丝的我了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_003_1012_p", "source_sha256": "061899b1b002a3cbc6bcd2a6bcc81f3ae7ce666774f0e200774c3c1528e2eb14", "ja": "ま、まだ大丈夫だ！\nそこでニッコリ笑えば、まだフォローできる！", "zh": "还、还不是问题！\n此时只要微笑一下，就还能挽救！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_003_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "eb567b8faad014f20307d02bfeaa69c5b7b673fd52179b6c4069d498cac1a1d0", "ja": "は、はい！　ニッコリと笑顔で、\n「噛んじゃいました。ごめんなさい」って言いますね！", "zh": "好、好的！我要微笑一下，\n说句「抱歉吃螺丝了」！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_003_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "c70edcfe86e1ca6aa551c54bac6313bbf0309ab8c8003f2d8a162e066bebc0cc", "ja": "あっ……み、みんな笑ってくれました！\nなんだか、劇場中がいい雰囲気になっていきますっ！", "zh": "啊……大、大家笑了！\n感觉剧场里的气氛变好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_003_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b58b425efe7f9c4fc824e8f5cc047f3c04aa51463c5a94fe4661d8484dafad8d", "ja": "ナイスだ、百合子！\nこのままの勢いで、歌とダンスに移行するんだ！", "zh": "很棒，百合子！\n就顺着这股气势，开始唱歌跳舞吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_003_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "eefacd8b3333c8ef53362c6187472e40a146c686b3216e29cc397ff428934bce", "ja": "はい！　ダンスを……ああっ！？\nい、いきなり、出だしで転んじゃう私！", "zh": "好！开始跳舞……啊啊！？\n是、是刚开头就快跌倒的我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_003_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "bdf42bdb38fc0952d156cb97109680ea735898ba72762eb3e806cda65cea3772", "ja": "どうしよう……このままじゃ、歌も……っ！", "zh": "怎么办……再这样下去，唱歌也会……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_003_1018_p", "source_sha256": "e947746d13f2d3b3107809ce62612a8ee33ec686265400447918c75e20319279", "ja": "あきらめるな！　そこですかさず……", "zh": "别放弃！此时就马上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_003_1019", "source_sha256": "ab318331be07b8e6367ea84b2214dc5dfcfb4ac2dbec38029095ca80c08c3032", "ja": "ターン！", "zh": "转圈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_003_2000_p", "source_sha256": "8dfd0aeaa3e5e701456e0f47e1c369d21065dc04c0a2ff8f23e082adac6ddc39", "ja": "ターンして、なんとかこらえよう！", "zh": "马上转圈，尽量撑住吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_003_2001_026yur", "source_sha256": "58b89b1cf370befee9abc8f463ba9d147deb46056c01a54db5de28ae8ce88e4b", "ja": "こ、こらえました……！\nあっ……お客さん達、たくさん拍手してくれてる……。", "zh": "我、我撑住了……！\n啊……观众们都在为我大力鼓掌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_003_2002_026yur", "source_sha256": "5dcb03884f04e6e0ff1e2602f04f9d5be8d4a5b920355329f13c6ec990f56beb", "ja": "や、やりました！\n無事にステージが終わりました！", "zh": "我、我办到了！\n平安无事地完成了表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_003_2003_p", "source_sha256": "9df5066ae518e8cd8ef447881c78956ffeac6231c70b50d9406f4cc3e45ed792", "ja": "よかった……。よく頑張ったな、百合子。", "zh": "太好了……你很努力呢，百合子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_003_2004_026yur", "source_sha256": "232fe15acddc04a10f80b2a66092a021aae72a33acadc7e32088ec828daf70d9", "ja": "はい、ありがとうございます！\n……ふぅ。", "zh": "是，非常谢谢！\n……呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_003_2005_026yur", "source_sha256": "e145a60a804a28066bac3539c5e0a89b840baf9f8ad8e6badbfb28ba17e31000", "ja": "最後まで想像してみたら、どんな失敗でも、\nカバーできる気がしてきました！", "zh": "试着想像到最后之后，我开始觉得\n不管是什么样的失败，都能挽救回来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_003_2006_p", "source_sha256": "67a375b140152236e365b88e8697055b3ff513837ed4d2011231c2b454ce7ce7", "ja": "そうか。\nイメージトレーニングの成果だな！", "zh": "是吗。\n这是想像训练的成果呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_003_2007_026yur", "source_sha256": "3f3f4d11f5a9c39fe7971e8be6e4aa9acd88524be83c541dfadc72027b7c408b", "ja": "はい！　……それに、{$P$}さんが、\n必ず舞台袖にいてくれるって、思えるから……。", "zh": "是啊……而且，总觉得{$P$}先生\n一定会守在舞台侧边……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_003_2008_026yur", "source_sha256": "45b76eeb62fd1b60123f2972a046d09fcd7843449fed2475488eb76d69b9e3b0", "ja": "私の中に、勇気の翼が広がっていくんです！\n……あの、見ててくださいね。私の、旅立ちの時です♪", "zh": "在我的心中，勇气的翅膀正逐渐张开羽翼！\n……那个，你可要好好看着，我的旅程正要展开呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_003_2009_p", "source_sha256": "0811a130834a284fcbbdd301ed6021962a34c46ce46f2593e0c0564076dab835", "ja": "（百合子が描く物語のターニングポイント。どうやら、\n何度も読み返したくなるページになりそうだ！）", "zh": "（这是由百合子所绘故事的转折点。\n看来这会是让人想反复阅读的精采扉页呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
